{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_014","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 215","char_start":4335,"char_end":4365,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_015","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Set aside funds in an escrow that delivers them to a predetermined recipient when certain conditions are met. If the escrow has an expiration, the funds can also be returned to the sender after it expires.","location_hint":"paragraph 227","char_start":4633,"char_end":4838,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_016","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"To escrow fungible tokens you must take note of the following:","location_hint":"paragraph 229","char_start":4848,"char_end":4910,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_017","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Trust Line Tokens must have the Allow Trust Line Locking flag enabled on their account.","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":4914,"char_end":5001,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_018","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Multi-Purpose-Tokens (MPTs) must have both the Can Escrow and Can Transfer flags enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 231","char_start":5003,"char_end":5092,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_019","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"All token escrows must specify a Cancel After time.","location_hint":"paragraph 232","char_start":5094,"char_end":5145,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_020","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"If the token requires authorization , both sender and recipient must be pre-authorized by the issuer.","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":5147,"char_end":5248,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_021","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Requires the TokenEscrow amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5252,"char_end":5299,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_022","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"{\n\"Account\" : \"rf1BiGeXwwQoi8Z2ueFYTEXSwuJYfV2Jpn\" ,\n\"TransactionType\" : \"EscrowCreate\" ,\n\"Amount\" : \"10000\" ,\n\"Destination\" : \"rsA2LpzuawewSBQXkiju3YQTMzW13pAAdW\" ,\n\"CancelAfter\" : 533257958 ,\n\"FinishAfter\" : 533171558 ,\n\"Condition\" : \"A0258020E3B0C44298FC1C149AFBF4C8996FB92427AE41E4649B934CA495991B7852B855810100\" ,\n\"DestinationTag\" : 23480 ,\n\"SourceTag\" : 11747\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5332,"char_end":5699,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_023","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"In addition to the common fields , EscrowCreate transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":5749,"char_end":5835,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_024","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":5839,"char_end":5880,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_025","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Amount Object or String Amount Amount of XRP, in drops, or fungible tokens to deduct from the sender&#x27;s balance and escrow. Once escrowed, the payment can either go to the Destination address (after the FinishAfter time) or be returned to the sender (after the CancelAfter time).","location_hint":"paragraph 241","char_start":5884,"char_end":6167,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_026","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Requires the TokenEscrow amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":6169,"char_end":6216,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_027","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Destination String AccountID Address to receive escrowed funds.","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":6220,"char_end":6283,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_028","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"CancelAfter Number UInt32 (Optional for XRP escrows, but mandatory for token escrows) The time, in seconds since the Ripple Epoch , when this escrow expires. This value is immutable; the funds can only be returned to the sender after this time.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6285,"char_end":6529,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_029","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"FinishAfter Number UInt32 (Optional) The time, in seconds since the Ripple Epoch , when the escrowed funds can be released to the recipient. This value is immutable, and the funds can&#x27;t be accessed until this time.","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":6531,"char_end":6750,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_030","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Condition String Blob (Optional) Hex value representing a PREIMAGE-SHA-256 crypto-condition . The funds can only be delivered to the recipient if this condition is fulfilled. If the condition is not fulfilled before the expiration time specified in the CancelAfter field, the funds can only revert to the sender.","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":6752,"char_end":7064,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_031","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"DestinationTag Number UInt32 (Optional) Arbitrary tag to further specify the destination for this escrowed payment, such as a hosted recipient at the destination address.","location_hint":"paragraph 247","char_start":7066,"char_end":7236,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_032","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"You must specify one of the following combinations of fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 248","char_start":7240,"char_end":7301,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_033","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Summary FinishAfter Condition CancelAfter","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":7305,"char_end":7346,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_034","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Time-based with expiration ✅ ✅","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":7375,"char_end":7405,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_035","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Timed conditional (XRP only) ✅ ✅","location_hint":"paragraph 252","char_start":7407,"char_end":7439,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_036","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Timed conditional with expiration ✅ ✅ ✅","location_hint":"paragraph 253","char_start":7441,"char_end":7480,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_037","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Conditional with expiration ✅ ✅","location_hint":"paragraph 254","char_start":7482,"char_end":7513,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_038","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"It is not possible to create a conditional escrow with no expiration, but you can specify an expiration that is very far in the future.","location_hint":"paragraph 255","char_start":7517,"char_end":7652,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_039","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Before the fix1571 amendment became enabled on 2018-06-19, it was possible to create an XRP escrow with CancelAfter only. These escrows could be finished by anyone at any time before the specified expiration.","location_hint":"paragraph 257","char_start":7662,"char_end":7870,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_040","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, EscrowCreate transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 259","char_start":7885,"char_end":8017,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_041","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"tecNO_PERMISSION The transaction failed because the necessary permissions for token escrow are not in place. For example, the issuer hasn&#x27;t enabled the Allow Trust Line Locking flag for a Trust Line Token.","location_hint":"paragraph 261","char_start":8047,"char_end":8257,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_042","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"tecNO_AUTH The transaction failed because authorization requirements for the token were not met. For example, the sender lacks authorization when creating the escrow.","location_hint":"paragraph 262","char_start":8259,"char_end":8425,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_043","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"tecUNFUNDED The sender lacks sufficient spendable balance. For Trust Line Tokens, this means the sender&#x27;s trust line with the issuer has insufficient available balance. For XRP escrows, this means the sender doesn&#x27;t have enough XRP.","location_hint":"paragraph 263","char_start":8427,"char_end":8669,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_044","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"tecOBJECT_NOT_FOUND The sender does not hold the MPT.","location_hint":"paragraph 264","char_start":8671,"char_end":8724,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_01e8d92d7e53_045","source_id":"src_01e8d92d7e53","source_hash":"0c21751fae60345eae798205a52feee423262f4a462f92a3c972a5112076bc4d","text":"tecFROZEN The token is frozen (for Trust Line Tokens) or locked (for MPTs) for the sender.","location_hint":"paragraph 265","char_start":8726,"char_end":8816,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:39.689Z"}
